# Coupon Management & Redemption - Implementation Walkthrough

## Overview

Successfully implemented coupon management and redemption functionality for the Vastra e-commerce application. Customers can now apply discount coupons on the cart page, and the discount is automatically reflected on the checkout page.

## Changes Made

### 1. Coupon Service Layer

#### [NEW] [couponService.js](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/services/couponService.js)

Created a new service to handle coupon-related API operations:

- **[validateCoupon(code, orderAmount)](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/services/couponService.js#8-64)**: Validates a coupon code against the backend API (`POST /api/coupon/validate`)
  - Checks authentication status
  - Validates input parameters
  - Returns coupon details including discount amount on success
  - Handles errors (invalid code, expired, minimum order not met)

- **[getActiveCoupons()](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/services/couponService.js#65-80)**: Retrieves all active coupons (`GET /api/coupon/active`)
  - Available for future feature enhancements (e.g., displaying available coupons to users)

The service follows the existing pattern used in [authService.js](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/services/authService.js) and [cartService.js](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/services/cartService.js) with proper error handling and authentication.

---

### 2. Cart Context Updates

#### [MODIFY] [CartContext.jsx](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/context/CartContext.jsx)

Enhanced the cart context with coupon state management:

**New State Variables:**
- `appliedCoupon`: Stores the currently applied coupon details (code, discount amount, coupon ID)
- `isCouponLoading`: Loading state for coupon validation requests
- `discountAmount`: Calculated discount amount from applied coupon
- `finalTotal`: Total amount after applying discount

**New Functions:**
- [applyCoupon(code, silent)](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/context/CartContext.jsx#197-237): 
  - Validates coupon via API
  - Updates state with coupon details
  - Shows success/error notifications
  - Supports silent mode for automatic re-validation
  
- [removeCoupon()](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/context/CartContext.jsx#238-243): 
  - Clears applied coupon
  - Shows notification

**Auto Re-validation:**
- Added `useEffect` hook to automatically re-validate coupon when cart total changes
- Ensures discount remains valid as items are added/removed from cart

**State Reset:**
- Coupon is cleared when user logs out
- Context properly exposes all coupon-related state to consuming components

---

### 3. Cart Page Implementation

#### [MODIFY] [CartPage.jsx](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/pages/CartPage.jsx)

Updated the [CartSummary](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/pages/CartPage.jsx#244-500) component with comprehensive coupon functionality:

**Coupon Input Section:**
- Text input for entering coupon code (auto-converts to uppercase)
- "Apply" button with loading state
- Real-time error display for invalid coupons
- Enter key support for quick application

**Applied Coupon Display:**
- Green success banner showing coupon code with checkmark
- "Remove" button to clear the coupon
- Smooth animations using Framer Motion

**Price Breakdown:**
- Subtotal (unchanged)
- **Discount row** (shows when coupon applied):
  - Displays coupon code
  - Shows discount amount in green with minus sign
- Shipping (FREE)
- **Total** (updated to show final amount after discount)

**Design:**
- Matches Vastra color scheme (maroon, gold/green accents, beige backgrounds)
- Consistent with existing cart summary styling
- Error states use red borders/text
- Success states use green backgrounds/text

---

### 4. Checkout Page Updates

#### [MODIFY] [CheckoutPage.jsx](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/pages/CheckoutPage.jsx)

Enhanced the Order Summary section to display applied coupons:

**Changes:**
- Accessed coupon state from [useCart()](file:///d:/vastra-ecommerce/frontend/src/context/CartContext.jsx#208-216) context
- Added discount row in price breakdown (between Subtotal and Shipping)
- Updated final total calculation to use `finalTotal` when discount is applied
- Display is read-only (coupons are applied on cart page only)

**Price Display:**
```
Subtotal: ₹2,500
Discount (SAVE10): -₹250  (shown in green)
Shipping: FREE
Total: ₹2,250
```

